{"script":"yd_011_05","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1c","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":160,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-206,"img":"chara011_1"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1c","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":160,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-206,"img":"chara011_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]唔～来营地借住已经有一段时间了，但缇莎好像只是在给你添麻烦……缇莎也想帮上你的忙！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]对了对了，最近天气挺热的，就让缇莎用魔法给营地里吹吹风吧！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1d","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]我想想……咒语是啥来着……应该是这个……呜哩哩叭啦咔咔！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]好耶，成功啦！你看，大家都感觉到凉爽了呢！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1g","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","y":-10,"d":0.8,"x":0},"key":"shake"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]唉？你说停一停？等、等等，风怎么越来越大了！[r]不、不对，这不是普通的风魔法，这是——是龙卷风的魔法！缇莎念错咒语了！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","y":0,"d":0.8,"x":10},"key":"shake"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]呜哩哩——不对，啊巴巴——不对，嘎咔咔——呜哇，龙卷风快停下啊啊啊——[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"缇莎-熟识2"}